      "content": "idk if im crazy but something weird is happening at work. every time i get really stressed or even just super angry during a meeting, the overhead lights start flickering or my computer monitor will just static out. it's happened like 4 times this week. do u think it's possible i'm somehow... i dont know, projecting some kind of kinetic energy or something when i'm upset?",
