      "content": "i hear what you're saying about the wiring, but it's so specific. like, it doesn't happen when i'm calm, only when my heart is racing or i'm feeling really intense stuff. and it's not just the lights, sometimes even my phone acts up right when i'm getting worked up. it feels way too consistent to be just a coincidence or my brain playing tricks on me. it feels like there's some kind of physical connection between my emotions and the tech around me. is there any way to actually test this or learn how to control it so it stops happening in front of everyone?",
